    "body": "This PR adds the `dbt` filetype to the dbt config, as #4384 did for `buf-config`. Neovim opens dbt models as `sql`, and plugins such as dbt-ft.nvim (which I maintain) give them a `dbt` filetype, parsed as Jinja with SQL injected. The brief says so and links it, as `alloy_ls` links vim-alloy.\n\nTested on Neovim 0.12.6 with dbt 2.0.9. A model attaches as `dbt` with dbt-ft.nvim loaded and as `sql` without it, and on master the `dbt` buffer gets no client.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-28T12:45:44Z",
